    "signal_artifact": "scripts/miner_3_20300307_acceleration_reversal_signal.csv",
    "regime_notes": "The 60-session signal passes both benchmark gates and is positive in both available middle (2024-2026) and late (2027-2030) regimes. The early partition has no observations because the 40-session baseline and 60-session forward horizon leave no aligned dates under the script's partitioning. Interpret conservatively because the cross-section is only 15 assets despite near-complete coverage."
  },
